# An outdoor station at morning. The recipe is Jubilife's; what makes it a
# separate station is the spec's `rtc`, so the four of them differ only
# in the hour and pin the arealight tint the time of day picks.
name JUBILIF
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 10000
money 3000
item ITEM_POKE_BALL 10
badge BADGE_ID_COAL
party SPECIES_MONFERNO 18 ITEM_NONE
map MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY 0xB4 0x309 FACE_DOWN
